# Third-party vendored assets

This directory ships pre-built third-party JavaScript so the `crib viz` web UI is fully offline
(no runtime CDN fetch). Sources are recorded here for license attribution and upgrade tracking.

## cytoscape.min.js

- Project: Cytoscape.js — https://js.cytoscape.org/
- Version: 3.34.x (as installed via npm; see the `cytoscape` dependency in the repo root)
- License: MIT — see `LICENSE.cytoscape` (Copyright (c) 2016-2026, The Cytoscape Consortium)
- How obtained: `cp node_modules/cytoscape/dist/cytoscape.min.js packages/ui/web/vendor/`
- Upgrade: bump the `cytoscape` npm dependency, re-copy `dist/cytoscape.min.js`, re-verify the
  `LICENSE.cytoscape` text is unchanged, and re-run `crib viz` to confirm compound nodes still render.